<title>BRAZIL: INSTANT VIEW- CSN group buys Brazil CVRD.</title>
<headline>INSTANT VIEW- CSN group buys Brazil CVRD.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are comments from analysts on the sale of state mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce to CSN's group. CSN purchased 41.7 percent of CVRD's voting shares for 3.3 billion reais. The group paid 20 percent above the base price.</p>
<p>MARCELO MESQUITA, equity analyst at Brazilian investment bank Garantia: &quot;This is something of a surprise and I think it is bad. We thought (other bidder) Votorantim would be willing to pay more for CVRD. But it is good for the government because they got a premium of 20 percent.&quot;</p>
</text>
